Subject: [PATCH v5 3/3] PCI: artpec6: Configure FTS with dwc helper function
Date:   Wed,  6 Nov 2019 11:44:03 +0800
Message-Id: <90a64d72a32dbc75c03a58a1813f50e547170ff4.1572950559.git.eswara.kota@linux.intel.com>
